~ start
set GameManager.player_speed = 0
Aren: What just happened...? Where am I?
Aren: That darkness behind me — it's moving. I have to keep going.
set GameManager.player_speed = 150.0
=> END

~ npc_1
set GameManager.player_speed = 0
Homeless Man: Please... help me. I fell and I can't get back up. My leg—
- Help him up
	Aren: Here, take my hand. Lean on me.
	Homeless Man: Thank you. Truly. You didn't have to stop.
	set GameManager.helped_homeless_man = true
	do increment_help_count()
- Keep moving
	Aren: I'm sorry. I can't stop right now.
	Homeless Man: Please... I'll die out here alone.
	set GameManager.helped_homeless_man = false
set GameManager.player_speed = 150.0
=> END

~ npc_2
set GameManager.player_speed = 0
Dog: *A starving dog blocks the path, teeth bared, growling low.*
- Offer it food
	if GameManager.have_food == true:
		Aren: Easy... here. This is all I have, but take it.
		Dog: *Sniffs cautiously, then steps aside. It watches you go with tired eyes.*
		set GameManager.food_given = true
		do increment_help_count()
	else:
		Aren: I'm sorry... I have nothing to give you.
		Dog: *Stares at you, then slowly moves aside.*
- Push past it
	Aren: Get out of my way. I don't have time for this.
	Dog: *Lunges forward — claws and teeth — there's no getting past it.*
	do die()
set GameManager.player_speed = 150.0
=> END

~ npc_3
set GameManager.player_speed = 0
Girl: Wait — please. I've been alone out here for so long. I'm scared.
- Take her with you
	Aren: Stay close. Keep up and don't fall behind — I won't slow down.
	Girl: I will. I promise. Thank you for not leaving me.
	do show_girl()
	do hide_real_girl()
	set GameManager.girl_taken = true
	do increment_help_count()
- Leave her behind
	Aren: It's too dangerous. I can't protect both of us right now.
	Girl: ...okay. I understand. Please be safe.
set GameManager.player_speed = 150.0
=> END

~ npc_1_a
set GameManager.player_speed = 0
if GameManager.helped_homeless_man == true:
	Homeless Man: You! You're the one who helped me back there.
	Homeless Man: I found this along the road. Take it — you'll need it more than I do.
	Homeless Man: And run. Whatever that darkness is... don't let it catch you.
	do increment_help_count()
	do give_speed_boost()
else:
	Homeless Man: YOU. You walked right past me and left me there to die.
	Homeless Man: I nearly didn't make it because of you.
	Homeless Man: *He lunges at you in rage.*
	do die()
set GameManager.player_speed = 150.0
=> END

~ npc_4
set GameManager.player_speed = 0
Suspicious Man: Stop right there. Out here, being polite gets you killed.
Suspicious Man: Show me you're not someone I need to worry about.
- Hold your ground
	Aren: Step aside. I'm not looking for trouble — but I won't back down either.
	Suspicious Man: *Studies you for a long moment, then moves.*
	Suspicious Man: Keep moving. And watch your back.
- Try to reason with him
	Aren: Look, I don't want any trouble. Can we just—
	Suspicious Man: Too slow. Too soft.
	Suspicious Man: *He doesn't give you a second chance.*
	do die()
set GameManager.player_speed = 150.0
=> END

~ npc_3_a
set GameManager.player_speed = 0
if GameManager.girl_taken == true:
	Girl: I found something back there while we were walking. Here — take it.
	Girl: I'm glad you didn't leave me behind.
if GameManager.girl_taken == false:
	Girl: *She hurls a rock at you and runs.*
	Aren: Ow! What was that—
set GameManager.player_speed = 150.0
=> END

~ npc_5
set GameManager.player_speed = 0
The Wanderer: H-hey... please. I haven't eaten in days. I'm not going to make it.
- Share what you have
	Aren: Here. Take it. You need it more than I do right now.
	The Wanderer: Thank you... thank you. I won't forget this. Keep running.
	do increment_help_count()
- Refuse
	Aren: I'm sorry. I need everything I have just to survive this.
	The Wanderer: You don't understand — I'm DESPERATE. I have nothing left!
	The Wanderer: *He throws himself at you. It's him or you.*
	do die()
set GameManager.player_speed = 150.0
=> END

~ npc_6
set GameManager.player_speed = 0
Hungry Girl: Excuse me... I'm really hungry. Do you have any food? I have water I can trade.
- Lie and take the water
	Aren: Sure, let me check. Hand me your bottle first.
	Aren: *Takes the water and keeps walking.*
	Hungry Girl: Hey! Wait — come back! You said—!
- Give her the food
	Aren: Here. Go on, eat.
	Hungry Girl: Are you sure? Thank you so much. Really.
	do increment_help_count()
set GameManager.player_speed = 150.0
=> END
